    "answer": {
      "short": "$30\\sqrt7$",
      "worked": "$$6300=2^2\\times3^2\\times5^2\\times7$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{6300}&=\\sqrt{2^2\\times3^2\\times5^2\\times7}\\\\\\sqrt{6300}&=2\\times3\\times5\\sqrt7\\\\\\sqrt{6300}&=30\\sqrt7\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
